WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.280
Jerusalem.

2
00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:05.530
A man from a family of priests
stands at the gate of the Temple.

3
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.750
His message: this house
could be destroyed,

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.230
like the older sanctuary at Shiloh.

5
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.430
Priests and prophets demand his death.

6
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:18.390
Why was warning about a building
almost a death sentence?

7
00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:24.270
In this mission, you'll follow Jeremiah
from his call in 627 BCE to the fall of

8
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:25.470
Jerusalem.

9
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:29.830
You'll hear him condemn a king who
builds his house with unpaid labour.

10
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.920
Then you'll read his promise
for after the disaster:

11
00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:36.020
a new covenant, written on the heart.

12
00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:40.990
Your mission: find out why Jeremiah's
words at the Temple gate nearly cost him

13
00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:41.800
his life.
